    {
      "id": "claim_474ced5d3533412c9d576afffd8a36a4",
      "statement": "Roles, permissions and role-permission grants are defined by seed fixtures 001_roles.json, 002_permissions.json and 003_role_permissions.json loaded via loaddata (post-deploy.sh runs migrate, loaddata, create-system-orguser, then clear_role_permissions). Because the role-permission map is cached in Redis, changes only take effect after the cache key is cleared.",
