      "id": "claim_2d2f634be3994ddbba9cc62c146351ba",
      "statement": "has_permission requires request.permissions to be a superset of the listed slugs, supports both sync and async views, and its inner check catches its own 403 and re-raises it as HTTP 404 'unauthorized'; this quirk is still listed as open in the resource-sharing tasks.",
