      "id": "claim_4ac2fb07192f41fe82906dc953568945",
      "statement": "Role.level is used for hierarchy guard rails: users cannot assign or invite a role above their own, nor update or delete a user with a higher role; deleting an OrgUser first reassigns their created dashboards, charts, metrics, KPIs, report snapshots and alerts to the acting admin.",
