    {
      "id": "claim_78c024654ec34ca4b3a9acb29b5e0a5a",
      "statement": "The access resolver in access_control.py grants edit to the creator or admin/super-admin, otherwise max-merges the user's direct and group ResourceShare grants; private resources then need a grant (else no_access) while non-private resources take the max of the grants and an org-wide floor chosen by role (analyst vs everyone else) from OrgPreferences. accessible_filter expresses the same rule as an ORM Q and get_user_access_map is the batch variant.",
      "evidence": [
        {
